@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 브라우저 문맥 헤더 누락: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kakao-static-image

### 같은 origin 문맥이지만 source 누락: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kakao-static-image
Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin
Referer: {{baseUrl}}/

### 지원하지 않는 메서드: 405
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kakao-static-image
Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin
Referer: {{baseUrl}}/
